{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_003_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b699766cb4676f924ad323c593176337df27b12cd4d1fcb966888dfb3f65fe74",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:163247d3d6d083db88ce3bef82b924e722d8460af8047cdfc8caa06f54a7145d",
      "text": "Ciao☆\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21619a21de0ff59cf7f24c94371591331585dd13dbdf29ae572483eeb57472c2",
      "text": "这是白色情人节的回礼礼物。\n请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f18728f3fe43a797b33f721e47b556522546c72d183f2dd53aa4b02c71eaebfd",
      "text": "收到的巧克力，\n非常美味哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eb467319511be9166f7015e137117cea1d54d59ff6354afb318ae669bcd44fb",
      "text": "我倾注了超越那盒巧克力所包含的\n更深沉的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:768d52251a29b4565dfadd2c45df4b92be9ae8d5a480acb0556b16a52df3eb7f",
      "text": "这份心意如果也能传达给你的话，\n我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fede4ba6e8ec080a2ff4aa95c10a098009fb5841efae27be66d15ee4d69e6e1f",
      "text": "今天的工作也辛苦你了。\n时间不知不觉已经有点晚了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2537ef15abe8f30defa737937f650e1f6d295b2f041445733a7ec5c5add16b89",
      "text": "不过，幸好依然是在今天的这一天之内呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9192e26096d66f16108774cd4c00965d460c6d55c6e23162a8cf52d6def078",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n请收下这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8448692a1efb230f968e034020252f8a1ec2740b2036f6683aec847238c63c1",
      "text": "这是情人节的回礼。\n上个月真的很谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e37e1fdc8829e0c8e1cc3642c7974d7d52a4320a42e361ecbbcaab10f308448",
      "text": "真高兴。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003ae410d36308394ee033ef3164e170607f954798c085d857d9177f30b6f186",
      "text": "我真的可以收下吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eae97919eb010179c7088cb4a7a90a19343e4e9c644624cd9f8f8d399adf866c",
      "text": "呵呵，你能感到高兴真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ada3093c9318eedee796c81a97c204d557ff3da150a1e96f471f6fd5d631aa71",
      "text": "那是当然的呀。\n不用客气，请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a144f4c95354e24f686d4173d62815c26849ec8a84f0199e9d380865746154a",
      "text": "我心中怀着对你的思念准备了这份礼物。\n如果你能收下的话我会很开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc285b1b209679d316a58886f3e3d68270eff45f986042e7b85c27a29371702e",
      "text": "里面的东西嘛……就当作拆开前的秘密吧。\n如果你能喜欢的话我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_003_22:5_02_003_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24118dc59c9837c194462d462ef55bba3f4d8f20f881853edd4546795dc2d19c",
      "text": "那么我们差不多也该回去了吧。\n护送回事务所的职责就交给我吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
